    "It couldn't be written out. The recording is still here; type a few words so you can find the note later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie udało się zapisać tego jako tekst. Nagranie wciąż tu jest; wpisz kilka słów, żeby łatwo znaleźć notatkę później."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It didn't work, show me the steps": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie zadziałało, pokaż mi kroki"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It hasn't been saved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie została zapisana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is removed from this iPhone and won't be brought up again. Notes you saved during it stay, and ElevenLabs keeps its own record as described in Settings › Privacy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zostanie usunięta z tego iPhone’a i nie będzie już przywoływana. Notatki zapisane podczas niej zostają, a ElevenLabs przechowuje własny zapis, jak opisano w Ustawieniach › Prywatność."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was in Keep's trash.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Była w koszu Keep."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was long, so only the first part was added.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Było długie, więc dodano tylko pierwszą część."
          }
        }
      }
    },
